## Issue Resolution

### Build Issues
1. Check error messages
2. Verify dependencies
3. Review recent changes
4. Check configuration

### Database Issues
1. Verify connection string
2. Check server availability
3. Validate permissions
4. Review schema

### Test Issues
1. Review failed tests
2. Check test environment
3. Verify test data
4. Review recent code changes

---

## Best Practices

1. Run healthcheck before deployments
2. Schedule regular healthchecks
3. Address issues immediately
4. Document known issues with workarounds
5. Keep healthcheck up to date with system changes

